    <string name="hdr_video_sub">HLG, with HEVC only, on lenses that offer it</string>
    <string name="video_footer">A frame rate is used only where the lens can record it at the chosen resolution; otherwise videos are 30 fps. The line under the viewfinder shows what is used.</string>

